    "en": "In Uzbekistan, alongside Uzbeks, Karakalpaks, Tajiks, Russians, Kazakhs, Kyrgyz, Turkmen and other peoples live together in harmony. People follow different religions. Being tolerant means respecting all peoples and faiths and treating everyone as a friend."
